  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37600020",
      "title": "Understanding The Context Window & Limitations",
      "sourceHash": "2be280f32730f2222040e15a7dce1e4505d3964566528f4a9c528981be0f16f0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.159,
          "end": 3,
          "en": "So, we now had a pretty detailed look at how",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.019,
          "end": 5.219,
          "en": "these models are trained and how they work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.519,
          "end": 8.199,
          "en": "There are a couple of important implications here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.5,
          "end": 11.44,
          "en": "One of the most important things to understand and keep",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.46,
          "end": 14.299,
          "en": "in mind is that all these models have a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.299,
          "end": 16.319,
          "en": "so-called context window.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.899,
          "end": 19.619,
          "en": "Remember that you feed a chat",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.779,
          "end": 22.739,
          "en": "history into those models or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.039,
          "end": 25.879,
          "en": "into the chat application, which then might enrich it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.879,
          "end": 28.519,
          "en": "filter it, but in the end forward it to the model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.519,
          "end": 31.419,
          "en": "So, we have a chat history here. And of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.439,
          "end": 33.979,
          "en": "course, this chat history might get pretty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.079,
          "end": 36.779,
          "en": "long, especially if you write long",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.86,
          "end": 38.92,
          "en": "questions or if you maybe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.319,
          "end": 42.199,
          "en": "attach a PDF document. That should also be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.2,
          "end": 45.099,
          "en": "considered by the model. Because what's happening with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.139,
          "end": 47.819,
          "en": "that PDF document, for example, that it's being",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.939,
          "end": 50.6,
          "en": "parsed by the ChatGPT application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.879,
          "end": 53.479,
          "en": "you could say. The text is extracted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.879,
          "end": 56.199,
          "en": "and simply inserted into your prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.459,
          "end": 59.359,
          "en": "So, before your question, all the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.379,
          "end": 62.299,
          "en": "text that was in the PDF document is inserted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.299,
          "end": 64.899,
          "en": "as additional text. That's how you can think of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.239,
          "end": 68.059,
          "en": "You're not doing that, but the ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.07900000000001,
          "end": 70.839,
          "en": "application is doing that, behind the scenes so to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.859,
          "end": 73.379,
          "en": "say. So, we have a lot of text in that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.57900000000001,
          "end": 76.439,
          "en": "chat history, and of course since the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.519,
          "end": 79.35900000000001,
          "en": "model needs to predict the next token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.699,
          "end": 82.65899999999999,
          "en": "based on the existing tokens, so based on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.699,
          "end": 85.35900000000001,
          "en": "the existing text, that prediction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.439,
          "end": 87.819,
          "en": "gets more and more difficult the more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.959,
          "end": 90.179,
          "en": "text there is. Because it needs to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.219,
          "end": 93.15899999999999,
          "en": "understand the complex relation between",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.779,
          "end": 96.719,
          "en": "the- the text at the beginning of the chat history and the text you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.759,
          "end": 99.15899999999999,
          "en": "have now, because all that might matter for the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.15899999999999,
          "end": 101.939,
          "en": "response. If you ask it to summarize",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.939,
          "end": 104.819,
          "en": "a 30-page PDF document,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.819,
          "end": 107.559,
          "en": "it, of course, needs to understand the relation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.619,
          "end": 110.559,
          "en": "between the words at the beginning of that document and the words at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.57900000000001,
          "end": 112.979,
          "en": "the end of the document, and all the words in between,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.65899999999999,
          "end": 115.619,
          "en": "and that, of course, is pretty difficult.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.63900000000001,
          "end": 118.399,
          "en": "It needs to be trained to do that. It",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.519,
          "end": 121.139,
          "en": "must be a model that is able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.199,
          "end": 123.999,
          "en": "to understand, so to say, such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.119,
          "end": 127.059,
          "en": "long token sequences, token sequences that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.119,
          "end": 129.579,
          "en": "might span thousands or tens of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.819,
          "end": 132.579,
          "en": "thousands of tokens. The next token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.699,
          "end": 135.459,
          "en": "that is likely is in the end based on all these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.559,
          "end": 138.299,
          "en": "previous tokens, and that's the so-called context window.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.699,
          "end": 140.939,
          "en": "Initially, the first models we had,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.139,
          "end": 143.779,
          "en": "ChatGPT based on the GPT-3",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.839,
          "end": 146.199,
          "en": "model, which was released in 2022,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.879,
          "end": 149.099,
          "en": "they had a very short context window.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.139,
          "end": 151.919,
          "en": "They were not able to handle vast amounts of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.959,
          "end": 154.779,
          "en": "input. They were great for short questions and answers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.97899999999998,
          "end": 157.559,
          "en": "but putting a long PDF document in there was not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.639,
          "end": 160.41899999999998,
          "en": "possible. More modern models are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.519,
          "end": 163.25900000000001,
          "en": "more capable, especially the Google Gemini",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 163.379,
          "end": 166.299,
          "en": "models are capable of handling even",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 166.699,
          "end": 168.799,
          "en": "millions of input tokens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 169.159,
          "end": 172.099,
          "en": "Quality may still degrade for long",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 172.159,
          "end": 175.079,
          "en": "inputs. That depends on the model and, of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 175.099,
          "end": 177.999,
          "en": "course, on your use case and is hard to measure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 178.499,
          "end": 181.359,
          "en": "But you can use certain models with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 181.619,
          "end": 184.479,
          "en": "lots of input value, and in general, these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 184.559,
          "end": 186.999,
          "en": "models have become more capable and all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 187.159,
          "end": 189.999,
          "en": "newer large language models have pretty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 190.439,
          "end": 193.139,
          "en": "decent, big context windows.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 193.499,
          "end": 196.239,
          "en": "So, that is growing and that, of course, is important to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.379,
          "end": 198.879,
          "en": "use these models for more complex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 198.939,
          "end": 201.799,
          "en": "tasks, like summarizing an entire book",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 202.039,
          "end": 204.799,
          "en": "or like extracting the essence of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 204.97899999999998,
          "end": 207.899,
          "en": "free PDF, uh, scientific papers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 207.939,
          "end": 210.919,
          "en": "you might want to give to them. So,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.139,
          "end": 212.959,
          "en": "that's one important thing to keep in mind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 212.959,
          "end": 215.879,
          "en": "There is a context window, which is growing, which is not a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 216.019,
          "end": 218.539,
          "en": "huge concern necessarily, but for certain tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 218.999,
          "end": 221.439,
          "en": "and certain models it still can be,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 221.699,
          "end": 224.439,
          "en": "especially the cheaper models, uh, of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 224.539,
          "end": 227.399,
          "en": "have more limited context windows. So, if you're trying",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.399,
          "end": 229.91899999999998,
          "en": "to build an application that uses an AI model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 230.359,
          "end": 233.279,
          "en": "to analyze and summarize huge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 233.31900000000002,
          "end": 236.219,
          "en": "PDF documents or websites, you still might face",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 236.31900000000002,
          "end": 239.139,
          "en": "problems there if you're using the wrong model, which",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 239.139,
          "end": 241.639,
          "en": "does not have a sufficiently large, uh,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 241.639,
          "end": 242.579,
          "en": "context window.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
      "lectureOrder": 14,
      "videoOrder": 14
    }
  ],
